# Allow-list: the build context is the parent folder, so send only what the image needs.
# Secrets (.env, secrets/, *.pem) and local data never enter the image.
**
!vulnfeed/vulnfeed.py
!vulnfeed/feeds.json
!vulnwatch/
vulnwatch/.env
vulnwatch/secrets
vulnwatch/**/*.pem
vulnwatch/data
vulnwatch/tools/node_modules
vulnwatch/**/__pycache__
vulnwatch/.git
